{
  "name": "clay",
  "label": "Clay",
  "description": "Plasticine and Play-Doh. Everything is squished out of soft, colorful clay: puffy rounded slabs with a matte grain, a thumbprint pressed into the cards and a marbled swirl on the featured one. Keys are clay blobs that squash when you press them, fields are pressed into the clay, badges are rolled pills, avatars are clay balls, progress is a twisted two-color clay rope and the spinner is four balls bouncing. A craft table by day, a green cutting mat after dark.",
  "fonts": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bagel+Fat+One&family=Nunito:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap",
